WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.345 --> 00:00:11.406
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> Before dinner, Gordon had a drink with Jeremy in the library.

2
00:00:17.053 --> 00:00:20.441
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Cheers, Jeremy. Happy Birthday.

3
00:00:20.507 --> 00:00:22.888
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Ah, thanks, Gordon.

4
00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:28.967
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Listen, Jeremy, I want to talk to you about Barbara.

5
00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:32.110
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Barbara? What’s the problem?

6
00:00:33.082 --> 00:00:39.707
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> It’s not exactly a problem. I’m in love with her, and I want to marry her.

7
00:00:40.763 --> 00:00:55.163
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Marry Barbara? Marry my daughter! Are you crazy? Never! You don’t love Barbara.

8
00:00:55.205 --> 00:00:56.598
You only want her money!

9
00:00:56.645 --> 00:00:58.922
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> That’s not true, Jeremy. I love her.

10
00:00:59.487 --> 00:01:06.470
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Listen to me. If you marry Barbara, when I die all my money goes to Claudia.

11
00:01:07.646 --> 00:01:10.808
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> To Claudia? To your secretary?

12
00:01:11.034 --> 00:01:12.107
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Yes.

13
00:01:13.142 --> 00:01:16.116
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Is that your last word, Jeremy?

14
00:01:16.323 --> 00:01:17.735
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Yes, it is.

15
00:01:17.961 --> 00:01:19.975
<v><b>Cook:</b></v> Dinner everybody!

16
00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:46.175
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> At midnight Gordon was in the living room. He finished his whisky and went upstairs.

17
00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:21.009
<v><b>Jeremy:</b></v> Who is it? Gordon? What are you…